éservataires, sous conditions de la signature d'un contrat de réservation jusqu'au 31/10/2026 et à la réitération de l’acte authentique de vente dans les 3 mois qui suivent la réservation.","addr":"Avenue Samuel Paty","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjMzYzM5Y2IwNGFhYTIzZjJlYzgwNzQwNzI3ZmJiNmI4NDA4NDg3MjIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIxY2VjM2Y2Yjk1OWI1MzY5ZDZhZjk2MDk3MWRhZmFiZSJ9?signature=44dd86bff3380a3342b8797d55cd91b32564c930b1040ec013a27b76c96d24ae","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjJmMjRjNWI4MGM0MDNlZjJhYWYxMTlhODQ2NWU5MzVmZjE4NDI1MTYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI4MTc5ZTcyMWUwOGQzMTRkMDgyZmMwMTQ4MzUyYjFjNSJ9?signature=2ec59735efd1bce3784133948661d175dc3f71601a6965a725196671c99df88c","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijc5MDAzYjI4NTFlMzI4NDM5NjNkOTBjZjBlMjcxZGJhMjAzNmFlNmMiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIzOWZiNzYzYWNmOWJmMzE2NGE1YjBkMTkyNjAwZDc2NiJ9?signature=18cb425d8ae119135c793fdbdefd39f80af529ecdfa27f626d5ba458601499ab"],"yt":[],"vr":[],"logo":"https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182ODc4YzRjMmE1ZDVjMi44NDA0MTMyNCIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6ODUsImhlaWdodCI6ODUsImZpdCI6ImNvdmVyIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6IjkzNTI5ZTY4NjkwMDJhNGE0MTc0MzY4ZDA1NTJhMThjMWEyNmZjYTUzYWI5ZDJlMWVlOWIxYmQyMWQzYTg1YTcifQ==?signature=b5d3a5cd4f667aa596b91fd70c8b5dcc518b8d09124727e7ed00342c1c66e1c0","zone":"B1","lots":[{"ty":"T2","na":"Appartement","s":42.27,"f":"3","ex":["N"],"ter":6.75,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":10.0,"p":167750.0},{"tva":20.0,"p":183000.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T3","na":"Appartement","s":57.75,"f":"2","ex":["O"],"ter":5